-county"],["ARC or PLC in San Saba County","/arc-plc/texas/san-saba-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids in San Saba County, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 40 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025, June to July ran 262% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value, and February to March ran 35%. Grid 13024 had its driest year in 1954 at 39% of normal.</p>"}
